    "Toggle metrics on or off to overlay them on the timeline graph below. We only show metrics you actually have data for — if a metric isn't here, that table is empty for your account (e.g. no sleep stages logged means no Deep / REM / Light chips). Highlighted ones were auto-detected from triggers / prodromes you've logged." to "Activa o desactiva métricas para superponerlas en el gráfico. Solo mostramos aquellas de las que tienes datos: si falta una, esa tabla está vacía en tu cuenta (sin fases de sueño no hay Profundo / REM / Ligero). Las marcadas salen de factores y pródromos que registraste.",
